Package: wanglinux-devel
Version: 1.0.0-1~aurora1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: WangLinux Project <dev@wanglinux.example>
Installed-Size: 10
Depends: wanglinux-base (>= 1.0.0), build-essential, git, cmake, ninja-build,
 pkg-config, make, gcc, g++, autoconf, automake, libtool, python3-dev,
 python3-venv, python3-pip, gdb, strace
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/wanglinux/wanglinux
Description: WangLinux development workstation (meta package)
 Pulls in the full C/C++/Python build toolchain plus version control and
 debugging tools. Install on top of wanglinux-desktop or wanglinux-server
 to turn WangLinux into a development machine.
